<p>Hello,</p>
<p>Someone asked to change the password for <%= @resource.email %>. If it was you, use the link below.</p>
<p><%= link_to "Change my password", edit_password_url(@resource, reset_password_token: @token), style: "color:#4B2EF5;" %></p>
<p>If it was not you, ignore this email. Your password stays the same.</p>
